title: "neurofuzzy: Reproducible Neurofuzzy Semantic Similarity Measurement"
abstract: >-
  A clean, reproducible Python implementation of a fuzzy-inference approach to
  semantic similarity measurement, with a unified benchmark harness, reference
  baselines, confidence intervals, significance testing, and publication-quality
  reporting. Companion code for the Data & Knowledge Engineering (2023) article.
